    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "telehealth still sounds like too much right now. i just want to make sure i'm doing the right thing at home so i dont have to go in. if i take a little bit of an aspirin and some extra salt in my food and just sleep it off, will that help stabilize my blood pressure or something? i just want to feel better so i dont have to worry about it.",
